subscribe.t.sol
├── when caller is not the {Space} declared in the inputs
│   └── it should revert with the {OnlySubscriptionSpace} error
└── when caller is the {Space} declared in the inputs
    ├── when the signed terms have expired
    │   └── it should revert with the {SignatureExpired} error
    ├── when the backend signature does not recover to the stored signer
    │   └── it should revert with the {InvalidBackendSignature} error
    └── when the backend signature is valid
        ├── when the subscription already exists
        │   └── it should revert with the {SubscriptionAlreadyExists} error
        └── when the subscription does not already exist
            ├── it should save the subscription details
            └── it should emit the {Subscribed} event
